// Orbit's niri entry point.
//
// Seeded, not linked: Noctalia's niri template appends its own include to this
// file, and orbit-niri-session re-seeds any include whose target has gone
// missing, because niri treats a missing include as a fatal parse error.
//
// Order matters.
//   orbit.kdl           Orbit's session: layout, rules, animations, keymap.
//   noctalia.kdl        Noctalia's palette. After Orbit so colours win.
//   orbit-overrides.kdl The few structural fields that must survive the palette.
//   monitor.kdl         This machine's outputs, written by nwg-displays.
//   local.kdl           Anything else of yours: workspaces, personal binds.
//
// monitor.kdl is nwg-displays' own default path for niri, so arranging monitors
// is the same GUI step as under Hyprland — and it must stay a writable regular
// file, because nwg-displays replaces a read-only symlink it finds there.
//
// Edit local.kdl for anything machine-specific that is not a monitor.
// Everything else is replaced wholesale by bootstrap/deploy.

include "orbit.kdl"
include "noctalia.kdl"
include "orbit-overrides.kdl"
include "monitor.kdl"
include "local.kdl"
